    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|cha00_banter_ques_D|159741",
      "en": "Hmm.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159910",
      "en": "I wonder where all the dancers went.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159911",
      "en": "I see why this place is so popular. It's got quite the, uh, view.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159912",
      "en": "Hey, Lieutenant, put your tongue back in your mouth before you trip on it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159914",
      "en": "Smell that? Fresh blood mixed with stale booze.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159915",
      "en": "A million light years from where humanity began and we walk into a bar filled with men drooling over half-naked women shaking their asses on a stage. I can't decide if that's funny or sad.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159916",
      "en": "What? You don't think they're here because of the food?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159918",
      "en": "We asari are more accepting of our sexuality than most other species. Some club owners like to exploit this by hiring us as dancers.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159920",
      "en": "C-Sec always turned a blind eye to what went on in here. I think Fist was paying someone off.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159922",
      "en": "Fist had a good thing going here. Too bad he got greedy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_banter_02_D|159924",
      "en": "Dancers are highly respected among my people. But I get the feeling these women are not held in high esteem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74533",
      "en": "Wait! Don't kill me! I surrender!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74589",
      "en": "The quarian isn't here. Said she'd only deal with the Shadow Broker himself.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74591",
      "en": "Here on the wards. The back alley by the markets. She's supposed to meet them right now. You can make it if you hurry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74593",
      "en": "Hey! I came clean! I told you about the meeting! Besides, I've got my own problems now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74594",
      "en": "The Shadow Broker wants me dead! I have to disappear. Forget about me. I'm a ghost.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74596",
      "en": "Don't worry. You'll never see me again.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74609",
      "en": "Where's the quarian?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74610",
      "en": "Tell me where the quarian is and I won't have to shoot you in the kneecaps.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74617",
      "en": "Give me the location. Now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74619",
      "en": "Am I supposed to just forget your part in all this?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74621",
      "en": "Too many people died here, Fist. You don't get to walk away.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74623",
      "en": "You're not my concern.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74624",
      "en": "There's no time to waste. Come on!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74705",
      "en": "I need information.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74706",
      "en": "Start talking.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74713",
      "en": "We have to save her!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74714",
      "en": "Where's the meeting?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74716",
      "en": "What about you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74717",
      "en": "Let's go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74719",
      "en": "You don't deserve to live.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|74720",
      "en": "Fine. Disappear.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86058",
      "en": "She's not here. I don't know where she is. That's the truth!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86059",
      "en": "He's no use to you now. Let me kill him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86060",
      "en": "He's lying.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86061",
      "en": "He's lying.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86062",
      "en": "Wait! Wait! I don't know where the quarian is, but I know where you can find her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86063",
      "en": "Nobody meets the Shadow Broker. Ever. Even I don't know his true identity. But she didn't know that. I told her I'd set a meeting up.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86064",
      "en": "But when she shows up, it'll be Saren's men waiting for her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86083",
      "en": "Put a round in his leg. See if he talks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86085",
      "en": "You'd better start explaining before I lose my temper.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86086",
      "en": "You've got three seconds to come clean. Then I start shooting.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86091",
      "en": "Tell me where that meeting is before I blow your lying head off!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86101",
      "en": "Shoot him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86102",
      "en": "What happened?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86103",
      "en": "Nobody lies to me, Fist!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|86109",
      "en": "You son of a bitch!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105182",
      "en": "Face to face? Impossible! Even I was hired through an agent.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105183",
      "en": "Impossible. The Shadow Broker only works through his agents.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105184",
      "en": "I thought the Shadow Broker only worked through agents.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105185",
      "en": "Here on the wards. The back alley by the markets. She's supposed to meet them right now. You can make it if you hurry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105187",
      "en": "Drop the gun, krogan!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105188",
      "en": "What are you doing?!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105189",
      "en": "Oh my God!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105190",
      "en": "The Shadow Broker paid me to kill him. I don't leave jobs half done.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105191",
      "en": "He was the only contract I had left. And don't we have something more pressing to worry about?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105192",
      "en": "How many people died because of him? He brought this on himself. Besides, we have more pressing concerns.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105193",
      "en": "That quarian's dead if we don't go now!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105194",
      "en": "That quarian's dead if we don't go now!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105195",
      "en": "That quarian is dead if we don't go now!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105206",
      "en": "I'm in charge here! You ever pull another stunt like that...",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105208",
      "en": "We don't shoot unarmed prisoners!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105210",
      "en": "A lot of people died because of him. He had it coming. Now let's move. We have to save that quarian!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105211",
      "en": "I never want to see you again. Is that clear?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105212",
      "en": "Smart move.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105223",
      "en": "Never do that again!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105224",
      "en": "He'd surrendered!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105225",
      "en": "He deserved it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|105228",
      "en": "Get out of here, Fist.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_06_DSG_LOC|sta60_fist_D|106465",
      "en": "Why do I have to do everything myself? Time to die, little soldiers!",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
}